msgid "[`rust-self-contained` components](#self-contained-objects)"
msgstr ""

#: src/3874-build-std-always.md:1594
msgid ""
"[Testing build-std in rust-lang/rust CI](#new-constraints-on-the-standard-"
"library-compiler-and-bootstrap)"
msgstr ""

#: src/3874-build-std-always.md:1595
msgid "Cargo"
msgstr ""

#: src/3874-build-std-always.md:1596
msgid "[`build-std.when = \"always\"`](#proposal)"
msgstr ""

#: src/3874-build-std-always.md:1597
